                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll 3 dice. For each roll that is at least double the target&apos;s Health characteristic, 1 model in the target unit is automatically slain.</characteristic>
